                  </did>
                  <accessrestrict>
                     <p>The original letter is extant and usually available for academic research purposes</p>
                  </accessrestrict>
                  <altformavail>
                     <p>a photostat is in MS. Toynbee d.32, Bodleian Library, Oxford. Both Mitford (1853) and Tovey (1900) erroneously give Mason as the addressee.</p>
                  </altformavail>
