                  <scopecontent>
                     <p>Incipit: "We perform'd our journey, a very agreeable one, within the time". Sent from <geogname normal="Durham (England, United Kingdom), county [7008127]"
                                  source="tgn">Durham</geogname>. to [Cambridge]. Dateline: "July 24. Tuesday". Address: "Durham". Envelope (front): "To / The Revd Mr Brown, M:A: / President of Pembroke Hall Cambridge / By Caxton" Postmark: "DURHAM". In the 1753 letter he gives details of his trip to Durham and the surroundings there;.</p>
                  </scopecontent>
